  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 10: Full TypeII vertex operator example\n\nR[c[1,z], bt[2,w]] from the plan example",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test10 = ToTeX[R[c[1, z], bt[2, w]]];\n(* Should give :partial c(z) bar{partial}^2 bar{b}(w): *)\ntest10HasPartialC = StringContainsQ[test10, \"\\\\partial c\"];\ntest10HasBarPartialB = StringContainsQ[test10, \"\\\\bar{\\\\partial}^2 \\\\bar{b}\"];\ntest10Result = test10HasPartialC && test10HasBarPartialB;\nPrint[\"Test 10 (R[c[1,z], bt[2,w]]): \", If[test10Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\nPrint[\"  Result: \", test10];\ntest10Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Test 10 (R[c[1,z], bt[2,w]]): FAILED\n</pre>",
